# which does not touch timeout budgets, context cancellation or bulkheads. The verification round
# showed it directly — P10-03 still reproduces at 11. What a level claims to solve must be present
# in its code, not in its intent.
#
# 11'in getirdiği şey GÖRÜNÜRLÜKtür: exemplar → trace, Loki, burn-rate alarmı, pprof. Bunlar
